  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Real-time updates in Lightning page?', a:'Streaming API (PushTopic/CDC) or Platform Events. Subscribe in LWC with empApi (lightning/empApi).' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Migrate 5 million records. Strategy?', a:'Bulk API 2.0 via Data Loader. Disable triggers/validations during load. Use External IDs for upsert. Load in phases.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Trigger causing recursion. Fix?', a:'Static Boolean flag in handler: if (hasRun) return; hasRun = true. Or use a recursion guard class.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Send email when record meets criteria?', a:'Declarative: Flow + Email Alert. Programmatic: Messaging.SingleEmailMessage in Apex.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Schedule a report every Monday?', a:'Use Subscribe button on report. Set Weekly (Monday). Choose recipients and format (HTML/Excel/CSV).' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Community user can\'t see fields. Fix?', a:'Check Community Profile FLS settings. Verify object permissions. Check sharing settings and assigned page layout.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'How to unit test a callout?', a:'Create class implementing HttpCalloutMock. Return fake HttpResponse. Test.setMock(HttpCalloutMock.class, new Mock()).' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Update 10,000 records nightly. Approach?', a:'Scheduled Batch Apex. Schedulable kicks off Batch nightly. Database.Batchable with scope size 200.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Restrict field to editable only on creation?', a:'Validation Rule: IF(NOT(ISNEW()), modified, false). Or set FLS read-only after creation via Flow.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Two triggers conflicting on same object. Fix?', a:'Merge into one trigger. Use Trigger Handler framework with before/after methods. Predictable execution order.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Log all field changes on Account. How?', a:'Field History Tracking (up to 20 fields). For more: custom trigger logging changes to an Audit__c object.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'LWC not refreshing after Apex DML. Fix?', a:'refreshApex(wiredResult) after DML. Or notifyRecordUpdateAvailable([{recordId}]) from lightning/uiRecordApi.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Implement approval process in code?', a:'Approval.ProcessSubmitRequest req. Set targetObjectId, submitterId, comments. Approval.process(req) to submit.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Notify VP when Opportunity > $1M. How?', a:'Record-Triggered Flow on Opportunity. Condition: Amount > 1000000. Action: Send Email Alert to VP role.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Expose Salesforce data to external system?', a:'Custom REST API with @RestResource. Or Connected App + OAuth + standard REST API. Secure with Named Credentials.' },
  { cat:'Scenario', q:'Component must work on mobile and desktop?', a:'Responsive CSS (flexbox/grid). Use @salesforce/client/formFactor in LWC to detect and adapt layout.' },
